  "description": "Calculates the spread as a percentage of the midpoint price.",
  "definition": "Spread Percentage = \\frac{askquote - bidquote}{midquote} \\times 100, \\text{where } askquote \\text{ is the best ask price, } bidquote \\text{ is the best bid price, and } midquote \\text{ is the midpoint price.}"
}

